{#
    The channel advice — the one place we say it, so every pay button says the same thing.

    A parent picks card / transfer / USSD on the provider's page, not ours, so this
    note is the only chance to steer them. Card pricing is materially worse for the
    school (1.5% + ₦100, capped at ₦2,000) than a transfer (1% capped at ₦300), and
    because the parent's own charge is capped at ₦500 the difference is paid by the
    school out of its fee.

    Numbers come from ProcessingFeeCalculator via the `payment_channels` Twig
    function — never hard-code a rate in this file.
#}
{% set rates = payment_channels() %}
<div class="mt-2 rounded-lg border border-ink-200 bg-ink-50 p-3">
    <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
        <strong class="font-semibold text-ink-900">Bank transfer is cheaper than card.</strong>
        A card costs the school {{ rates.card }}; a transfer costs {{ rates.transfer }}.
        Your total is the same either way — the extra comes out of the school&rsquo;s fee,
        so choose <strong>transfer</strong> (or USSD) when the payment page asks.
    </p>
</div>
